    "**Solution**\n",
    "\n",
    "|                                         | Kevin (£) | Judy (£) |\n",
    "|-----------------------------------------|-----------|----------|\n",
    "| Employment income = net income          | 35,500    | 6,000    |\n",
    "| Less: PA (Note)                         | (12,570)  | (6,000)  |\n",
